# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
#  WheelGenie Backend — Environment Variables Reference
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your values:
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# Fields marked ⚠️ are required — the app will fail without them.
# Fields marked ✅ have safe defaults and are optional.
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# ─── Server ────────────────────────────────
# ✅ Port the Express server listens on (used in src/server.js)
PORT=5000

# ✅ Runtime environment: "development" | "production"
#    Used in server.js, errorHandler.js, authController.js to control
#    cookie security (sameSite/secure), error detail visibility, and
#    dev-only response fields (reset URL, OTP, stack traces).
NODE_ENV=development

# ─── Database ──────────────────────────────
# ✅ MongoDB connection string (used in src/config/db.js)
#    Defaults to mongodb://127.0.0.1:27017/wheelgenie if unset.
MONGODB_URI=mongodb://127.0.0.1:27017/wheelgenie

# ─── JWT Authentication ────────────────────
# ⚠️ Secret key used to sign and verify access tokens.
#    Used in src/middleware/authMiddleware.js (verify) and
#    src/controllers/authController.js (sign). Generate a strong
#    random string for production.
JWT_SECRET=your_jwt_secret_key_change_in_production

# ✅ How long the access token remains valid (default: "1d").
#    Format: number + unit (e.g. 15m, 1h, 7d). Used in authController.js.
JWT_EXPIRES_IN=1d

# ⚠️ Secret key for signing refresh tokens (separate from JWT_SECRET).
#    Used in authController.js for refresh token rotation.
JWT_REFRESH_SECRET=your_jwt_refresh_secret_key_change_in_production

# ✅ Refresh token lifetime (default: "7d"). Used in authController.js.
JWT_REFRESH_EXPIRES_IN=7d

# ─── Google Gemini AI ──────────────────────
# ⚠️ API key for Google Gemini AI model (gemini-2.0-flash).
#    Used in src/ai/geminiService.js for AI vehicle evaluation and
#    price valuation features. Get one at https://aistudio.google.com/
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# ─── Cloudinary (File Uploads) ─────────────
# ⚠️ Cloud name from your Cloudinary dashboard.
#    Used in src/config/cloudinary.js for all image/document uploads.
CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME=your_cloud_name

# ⚠️ API key from your Cloudinary dashboard.
#    Used alongside the cloud name for authenticated API calls.
CLOUDINARY_API_KEY=your_api_key

# ⚠️ API secret from your Cloudinary dashboard.
#    Keep this secret — used to sign Cloudinary API requests.
CLOUDINARY_API_SECRET=your_api_secret

# ✅ Maximum uploaded file size in bytes (default: 10 MB = 10485760).
#    Used in uploadController.js to reject oversized files before upload.
MAX_FILE_SIZE=10485760

# ─── Client / CORS ─────────────────────────
# ✅ Frontend URL for CORS and redirects (development default).
#    Used when configuring allowed origins for cross-origin requests.
#    For local Vite dev: http://localhost:5173
#    For production: https://yourdomain.com
CLIENT_URL=http://localhost:5173
